  "body": "I don't think anything needs to change in the algorithms to support Web Workers but we should add a worker example to the spec. I don't think we have to do that in this patch. Wait until we've added a worker to an existing WebUSB app and have a sense of the best practices.\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @reillyeon in https://github.com/WICG/webusb/pull/130_",
